<title>USA: Apache Medical executives resign.</title>
<headline>Apache Medical executives resign.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>APACHE Medical Systems said Friday that three executives have resigned from the computer systems maker for personal reasons.</p>
<p>APACHE Chief Executive Officer Gerald Bisbee said: &quot;One person left to start her own marketing firm and the other two resigned for personal reasons.&quot;</p>
</text>
